      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "지표는 **몇 건·얼마나 오래**까지. **어느 송금인지**는:\n\n- **로그 (Loki)**: Explore → Loki → `{namespace=\"bank\", app=\"transfer\"} |= \"해소\"` → 송금마다 `transferId=… 이전 → 다음` 한 줄. 못 푼 것만: `|= \"해소 못 함\"`\n- **DB (DataGrip)**: `./infra/scripts/db-forward.sh transfer` → localhost:15433\n\n```sql\nSELECT id, kind, status, created_at, now() - created_at AS age\nFROM transfer.transfer\nWHERE status IN ('PROCESSING','UNKNOWN','WITHDRAW_REQUESTED','WITHDRAWN',\n                 'EXTERNAL_BANK_REQUESTED','WITHDRAW_CANCEL_REQUESTED')\n  AND created_at < now() - interval '1 minute'\nORDER BY created_at;\n```"
      }
